# Build output. `go build ./...` writes no binary, but an operator building
# freesided by hand for `scripts/install-mac-app.sh --daemon-path` lands it
# here, and the repository has no root ignore file to cover it. An untracked
# artifact is not harmless: it gives the build a `-dirty` stamp, and the
# composition preflight `freesided deputy` runs before real work rejects a
# daemon carrying one.
#
# Anchored to this directory so a future `internal/<pkg>/testdata/bin/`
# fixture stays trackable.
/bin/
